  (45, 'Digital Marketing Summer Intern', 'Aster Healthcare Tech', 'asterht.in', 'careers@asterht.in', 'Indore, MP', 'onsite', 'Business & Analytics', 'About the role: Digital Marketing Summer Intern at Aster Healthcare Tech. You will own a scoped project end to end under the guidance of a senior engineer, participate in daily standups, code reviews and sprint planning. We expect strong fundamentals, curiosity and the ability to read unfamiliar code. Deliverables are reviewed weekly and you will present your work to the team at the end of the internship. Mentorship, learning budget and a certificate of completion are provided. Selection process: online assessment, technical interview and a short manager conversation.

