  (80, 'NLP Research Intern — Core Infrastructure', 'Aarogya Health AI', 'aarogyahealth.ai', 'careers@aarogyahealth.ai', 'Ahmedabad, GJ', 'remote', 'Data Science & ML', 'About the role: NLP Research Intern — Core Infrastructure at Aarogya Health AI. This internship sits inside our product engineering pod. You will write production code, write tests, fix real defects reported by users and contribute to documentation. Our stack is modern and our code review culture is strong — expect detailed feedback on every pull request. Work mode is hybrid with two days in office for collaboration. Top performers receive a pre-placement offer at the end of the term.

