  (172, 'Manual QA Intern — Applied Research', 'Bosch India', 'bosch.in', 'careers@bosch.in', 'Coimbatore, TN', 'onsite', 'QA & Testing', 'About the role: Manual QA Intern — Applied Research at Bosch India. We are looking for curious students who want to see how real products are built. Day to day you will collaborate with designers and engineers, break down problems, and ship incremental improvements. Requirements: solid coursework in your discipline, good communication, willingness to learn fast. Interviews are technical + behavioural. Stipend is paid monthly and travel reimbursement is available for on-site days.

