  (274, 'Mechanical Design Intern', 'EY GDS', 'ey.com', 'campus.hiring@ey.com', 'Kochi, KL', 'onsite', 'Mechanical Engineering', 'About the role: Mechanical Design Intern at EY GDS. You will own a scoped project end to end under the guidance of a senior engineer, participate in daily standups, code reviews and sprint planning. We expect strong fundamentals, curiosity and the ability to read unfamiliar code. Deliverables are reviewed weekly and you will present your work to the team at the end of the internship. Mentorship, learning budget and a certificate of completion are provided. Selection process: online assessment, technical interview and a short manager conversation.

Responsibilities: collaborate with the mechanical team, write code and documentation, take part in reviews and standups, and deliver a presentable outcome at the end of 6 months.

Requirements: autocad, cad modeling, manufacturing. Strong fundamentals, good communication and willingness to learn. Preferred graduation year 2026 with CGPA above 6.5.

