  (362, 'DevOps Intern', 'Aster Healthcare Tech', 'asterht.in', 'campus.hiring@asterht.in', 'Chennai, TN', 'onsite', 'Cloud & DevOps', 'About the role: DevOps Intern at Aster Healthcare Tech. We are looking for curious students who want to see how real products are built. Day to day you will collaborate with designers and engineers, break down problems, and ship incremental improvements. Requirements: solid coursework in your discipline, good communication, willingness to learn fast. Interviews are technical + behavioural. Stipend is paid monthly and travel reimbursement is available for on-site days.

